#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:5 d0ba5e3b7b914f68903f900b34d73a1c
msgid "Land Mode"
msgstr "Land模式"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:7 4593bf0f976d45e3a125db6565621d18
msgid ""
"LAND Mode attempts to bring the copter straight down and has these features:"
msgstr "Land模式尝试使飞机垂直降落，具有以下特性："

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:10 25bd34806e034158b9499ad0ac7e6c30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"descends at :ref:`LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS<LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS>`, if non-zero, (or "
":ref:`WP_SPD_DN <WP_SPD_DN>` if zero) using the regular Altitude Hold "
"controller."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`LAND_SPEED_HIGH<LAND_SPEED_HIGH>` 不为零，则以该速度下降（若为零则使用 "
":ref:`WPNAV_SPEED_DN<WPNAV_SPEED_DN>`），使用常规定高控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:11 cbf56efff150447f8bc3d044beade650
msgid ""
"the pilot can reposition the vehicle using the pitch and roll sticks unless "
"the :ref:`LAND_REPOSITION <LAND_REPOSITION>` parameter is changed to \"0\". "
"The throttle stick has no effect by default, although high throttle can "
"cancel landing if enabled via :ref:`PILOT_THR_BHV<PILOT_THR_BHV>`."
msgstr ""
"除非将 :ref:`LAND_REPOSITION <LAND_REPOSITION>` 参数改为 "
"\"0\"，否则飞手可以使用俯仰和横滚摇杆重新定位飞行器。默认情况下油门摇杆无效，但如果通过 "
":ref:`PILOT_THR_BHV<PILOT_THR_BHV>` 启用，高油门可以取消降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:12 df4eb469689947ae8bfe7c64410c978f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"if a rangefinder is being used, or :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` =1 "
"and terrain data is available, the descent speed will then switch to "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` at :ref:`LAND_ALT_LOW_M<LAND_ALT_LOW_M>` "
"altitude (default is 10m) above ground until landing occurs. If neither "
"terrain data or rangefinder data is available, then altitude above HOME will"
" be used for the speed switch point (if reached)."
msgstr ""
"如果使用了测距仪，或 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` =1 "
"且地形数据可用，则在距地面10m高度时下降速度将切换为 "
":ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>`，直至降落完成。如果地形数据和测距仪数据均不可用，则将使用相对Home点的高度作为速度切换点（如能到达的话）。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:17 d2df7b0a4f094f9ab2c25fbd83eb1e91
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"below 10m the copter should descend at the rate specified in the "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` parameter which defaults to 50cm/s."
msgstr "在10m以下，飞机应以 :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` 参数指定的速度下降，默认值为50cm/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:23 c2420eeab8924536a85b5f3c23608361
msgid ""
"Upon reaching the ground the copter will automatically shut-down the motors "
"and disarm the copter if the pilot's throttle is at minimum."
msgstr "触地后，如果飞手的油门处于最低位置，飞机将自动关闭电机并上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:28 f1a6410c887a4184bac8968bea9c3fb0
msgid ""
"Copter will recognise that it has landed when ALL of the following are true "
"for approximately one second:"
msgstr "当以下所有条件持续满足约一秒时，Copter 会判定已经着陆："

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:31 4502c0f86bbd42fab8074e7089a31e19
msgid ""
"Motors are commanded to their lower limit by the vertical position "
"controller"
msgstr "电机被垂直位置控制器命令到其下限"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:32 5107b7a962464fa5aae912be16758760
msgid "Throttle is at minimum"
msgstr "油门处于最小值"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:33 ef6c89d7189642ed95b28cad0a835f47
msgid "No large angle is being requested (roll/pitch target < 15°)"
msgstr "未请求大角度（横滚/俯仰目标 < 15°）"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:34 3dc4e01fce8846e69b2a802e0d7698df
msgid "No large angle error exists (attitude error < 30°)"
msgstr "不存在大的角度误差（姿态误差 < 30°）"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:35 26ae31bb13814db0b1fc87c83d419943
msgid ""
"The airframe is not accelerating downward > 1m/s/s ( >2 m/s/s if Weight on "
"Wheels feature is enabled)"
msgstr "机体向下的加速度未超过 1m/s/s（若启用了 Weight on Wheels（轮上重量）功能则为 2 m/s/s）"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:36 65f47900e57843dcafdf90391afec947
msgid ""
"Vertical speed is within 1 m/s of zero ( within 2 m/s if Weight on Wheels "
"feature is enabled)"
msgstr "垂直速度在零附近 1 m/s 范围内（若启用了 Weight on Wheels（轮上重量）功能则为 2 m/s 以内）"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:37 54a465765e0346a4a71986922c3d6564
msgid ""
"If a healthy rangefinder is available, and rangefinder altitude is below 2m"
msgstr "如果有正常工作的测距仪可用，且测距仪高度低于 2m"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:38 291142a5ecab4b03b6b70dcaeb7f15c0
msgid ""
"Weight-on-Wheels (WoW) sensor (if present) confirms contact or is unknown"
msgstr "轮上重量（WoW）传感器（若存在）确认已接地或状态未知"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:40 1b68f8d13c2e424d8d8f9c2f723c9a7e
msgid ""
"Altitude above home is **not** used as a motor shutoff condition (except "
"when a rangefinder is used,see above). The ``LAND_ALT_LOW_M`` parameter "
"(default 10m) only controls the **descent speed transition** from "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS<LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS>` to :ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>`"
" — it has no role in landing detection or disarming."
msgstr ""
"家点以上高度 **不** 用作电机停转条件（使用测距仪时除外，见上文）。``LAND_ALT_LOW_M`` 参数（默认 10m）仅控制从 "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS<LAND_SPD_HIGH_MS>` 到 :ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` "
"的 **下降速度切换**，它对着陆检测或上锁没有任何作用。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:45 90ea2b52af7b44f4bf16df39a50ae18c
msgid ""
"For Traditional Heli, the low motor check in the above landing detection "
"algorithm is replaced with a check that Collective output is below mid-"
"position (controlled by the vertical position controller, ie in descent). "
"The rotor still may be at governor speed up until Motor Interlock is removed"
" and  disarming occurs."
msgstr ""
"对于传统直升机，上述降落检测算法中的低电机输出检查被替换为检查总距输出是否低于中间位置（由垂直位置控制器控制，即处于下降状态）。在电机互锁解除和解锁发生之前，旋翼仍可能保持调速器转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:47 6f09d91d40274787bf8a37b0e035785d
msgid ""
"Using a Weight on Wheels (WoW) switch will increase the descent rate and "
"accelerometer ranges that are acceptable for landing detection. This feature"
" is enabled anytime the LGR_WOW_PIN is not disabled."
msgstr "使用轮载（WoW）开关将扩大降落检测可接受的下降速率和加速度计范围。只要LGR_WOW_PIN未被禁用，此功能即会启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:52 afc05c5eb3a5429fa4ba9925441e2222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the copter appears to bounce or balloon back up a couple of times before "
"settling down and turning the props off, try lowering the "
":ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` parameter a bit."
msgstr "如果飞机在停止并关闭螺旋桨之前出现多次弹跳或反弹上升，请尝试适当降低 :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` 参数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:55 d1c3a59871c74bbab8d8bc0a5ec82cce
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the vehicle has GPS lock the landing controller will attempt to control "
"its horizontal position, but the pilot can adjust the target horizontal "
"position just as in Loiter mode, unless the "
":ref:`LAND_REPOSITION<LAND_REPOSITION>` parameter is set to 0."
msgstr "如果飞行器已获取GPS锁定，降落控制器将尝试控制其水平位置，飞手可以像在Loiter模式下一样调整目标水平位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:59 e5b248867b67424fbdfb5dcf3cc0eba2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not have GPS lock the horizontal control will be as in "
"stabilize mode, so the pilot can control the roll and pitch lean angle of "
"the copter, unless the :ref:`LAND_REPOSITION<LAND_REPOSITION>` parameter is "
"set to 0."
msgstr "如果飞行器未获取GPS锁定，水平控制将与Stabilize模式相同，飞手可以控制飞机的横滚和俯仰倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:66 b34deec1856e466cb0c8ff461cc19792
msgid ""
"In any Alt Hold based mode including: Alt Hold, Loiter, Auto, Auto NAV_Land "
"or RTL if your copters operation becomes erratic when you are close to the "
"ground or landing (and also if any auto landing procedure results in "
"bouncing or failure to turn off motors properly after landing) you probably "
"have the autopilot situated such that its barometer (altimeter) is being "
"affected by the pressure created by the copters prop-wash against the "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"在任何基于定高的模式中，包括：AltHold、Loiter、Auto、Auto NAV_Land 或 "
"RTL，如果在接近地面或降落时飞机操控异常（以及任何自动降落程序导致弹跳或降落后无法正常关闭电机），很可能是飞控被放置在受到螺旋桨下洗气流打地面后气压变化影响的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:76 da223eca5c894e3aa12b3709cf62e6be
msgid ""
"This is easily verified by looking at the Altimeter reading in your logs and"
" seeing if it spikes or oscillates when near the ground."
msgstr "可通过查看日志中的高度计读数，观察接近地面时是否出现尖峰或振荡来验证这一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:78 6e53e7de3e1545669513a1c9c63b671d
msgid ""
"If this is a problem, move the autopilot out of prop wash effect or shield "
"it with an appropriately ventilated enclosure."
msgstr "如果存在此问题，请将飞控移至不受螺旋桨下洗气流影响的位置，或用具有适当通风的外壳对其进行屏蔽。"

#: ../../source/docs/land-mode.rst:80 c777cdf2ab274850910ac2df5e33c9af
msgid "Success can be verified by flight test and by log results."
msgstr "成功与否可通过飞行测试及日志结果来验证。"

